## Quick Start: Read-Only Audit Script

Before deleting anything, you can run the included read-only PowerShell audit script (`scripts/audit-storage.ps1`) from an **Administrator PowerShell** window to map your drive safely:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\audit-storage.ps1
```

