## Phase 3: Developer Tools & Cache Cleanup

### 3.1 Remove Ollama App & Local LLM Weights
```cmd
taskkill /f /im ollama.exe /im "ollama app.exe" 2>nul
rmdir /s /q "%USERPROFILE%\.ollama"
"%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Ollama\unins000.exe"
```

### 3.2 Remove Unused WSL Distributions & Disable Feature
```cmd
wsl -l -v
:: If a distro exists, unregister it first:
:: wsl --unregister <DistroName>
dism.exe /online /disable-feature /featurename:Microsoft-Windows-Subsystem-Linux /norestart
```

### 3.3 Replace Heavy Anaconda3 (~10–30 GB) with Lightweight Jupyter (~200 MB)
1. Uninstall **Anaconda3** from **Settings → Apps → Installed apps**.
2. Clear leftover Conda directories:
   ```cmd
   rmdir /s /q "%USERPROFILE%\anaconda3" "%USERPROFILE%\.conda" "%LOCALAPPDATA%\conda"
   ```
3. Install standalone Jupyter Notebook on your existing Python installation:
   ```cmd
   pip install notebook
   ```

### 3.4 Purge Package Caches, Stale Installers, & Recycle Bin
```cmd
rmdir /s /q "%LOCALAPPDATA%\pip\cache" "%LOCALAPPDATA%\Downloaded Installations"
powershell -Command "Clear-RecycleBin -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
```

