## Phase 4: Windows System Optimization

1. **Disable Hibernation (Reclaims `hiberfil.sys`, ~6–16 GB):**
   *(Only run if you do not use Hibernate mode.)*
   ```cmd
   powercfg -h off
   ```
2. **Clean Superseded Windows Update Components (`WinSxS`):**
   ```cmd
   Dism.exe /online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup
   ```
3. **Reboot Windows** to unload disabled features and flush system memory.

